tive/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-02T04:42:19Z","updated_at":"2025-04-02T04:44:02Z","body":"I'm seeing the same result (in panel chat: cmd+ctrl+i), where the LLM correctly recognizes the instructions to use tabs, but the Github Copilot Chat (in VS Code) shows the code with spaces in the codeblock.\n\nIt seems that the LLM generates the code block with tabs, but Github Copilot converts it into spaces, which is troublesome.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release/issues/comments/2771325606/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release/issues/comments/2772658587","html_url":"https://github.com/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release/issues/7189#issuecomment-2772658587","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release/issues/7189","id":2772658587,"node_id":"IC_kwDOJYd5Dc6lQ2mb","user":{"login":"alexdima","id":5047891,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUwNDc4OTE=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5047891?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexdima","html_url":"https://github.com/alexdima","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexdima/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexdima/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexdima/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexdima/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexdima/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexdima/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexdima/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexdima/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexdima/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":true},"created_at":"2025-04-02T13:59:45Z","updated_at":"2025-04-02T13:59:45Z","body":"I can reproduce! I use the following prompt:\n\n> Generate me a fibonacci implementation in TypeScript. You MUST use tabs.\n\nI can see the raw model output is (which contains tabs):\n\n```typescript\nfunction fibonacci(n: number): number {\n\tif (n <= 1) {\n\t\treturn n;\n\t}\n\treturn fibonacci(n - 1) + fibonacci(n - 2);\n}\n\n// Example usage\nconsole.log(fibonacci(10)); // Output: 55\n```\n\nYet the code block appears with spaces:\n\n<img width=\"327\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/3ea633b4-1a46-4d1b-b7f0-80ad017c2d23\" />","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release/issues/comments/2772658587/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release/issues/comments/2780582049","html_url":"https://github.com/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release/issues/7189#issuecomment-2780582049","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release/issues/7189","id":2780582049,"node_id":"IC_kwDOJYd5Dc6lvFCh","user":{"login":"oomek","id":2974860,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI5NzQ4NjA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2974860?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/oomek","html_url":"https://github.com/oomek","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oomek/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oomek/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oomek/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oomek/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oomek/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oomek/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oomek/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oomek/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oomek/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-05T08:29:05Z","updated_at":"2025-04-05T08:29:05Z","body":"I'm having the same issue. Copilot insists that it used tabs, but for some reason the markdown is converting all tabs to spaces. Can this be fixed from the extension side, or it's an issue with vscode api and should be reported there?","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release/issues/comments/2780582049/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release/issues/comments/2824980849","html_url":"https://github.com/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release/issues/7189#issuecomment-2824980849","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release/issues/7189","id":2824980849,"node_id":"IC_kwDOJYd5Dc6oYclx","user":{"login":"richardtallent-erm","id":63666729,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYzNjY2NzI5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/63666729?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardtallent-erm","html_url":"https://github.com/richardtallent-erm","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardtallent-erm/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardtallent-erm/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardtallent-erm/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardtallent-erm/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardtallent-erm/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardtallent-erm/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardtallent-erm/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardtallent-erm/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardtallent-erm/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-23T17:09:40Z","updated_at":"2025-04-23T17:09:40Z","body":"I use tabs too (yeah, I'm a rebel), and Copilot code completions and Agent responses *are* using tabs correctly for left-hand indentation.\n\nSo, the users experiencing that issue for line indentation may want to check:\n\n- Using Prettier rather than the default VSC formatter for SQL files\n- Check Prettier options (if in use) to ensure you're using tabs\n- Ensure the following workspace and user settings:\n  - `\"editor.detectIndentation\": false`\n  - `\"editor.insertSpaces\": false`\n\nI *did* (a day or two ago) have problems where Copilot Agent mode would replace tabs with spaces *inside* of a code line where it was making edits -- I use tabs to align conditions in SQL WHERE clauses, UPDATE assignments, etc. for readability. (I wrote a VSC extension (\"Column Aligner\") that helps with this.)\n\nBut today when I tried to give Copilot instructions to replicate that issue, it left my tabs intact, and when instructed, used tabs in a halfway-reasonable way to column-align its own code. So maybe I was just having bad luck with a moody LLM temperature, or maybe this was fixed (the Copilot extension seems to be updating almost daily -- not a complaint).","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release/issues/comments/2824980849/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release/issues/comments/2944955840","html_url":"https://github.com/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release/is